  "body": "Fall in love with this beautifully refurbished three-bedroom character home, perfectly positioned in the heart of sought-after Red Beach.\r\n\r\nLovingly transformed with modern upgrades, including double glazing and stylish James Hardie Axon panel cladding, this charming home effortlessly combines character, comfort and contemporary living.\r\n\r\nLocation is everything! Enjoy the convenience of being just moments from the Red Beach shops and popular Red Beach Primary School, with the beautiful beach an easy stroll away. Silverdale Mall and motorway access are also close by, making everyday living a breeze.\r\n\r\nPositioned on a cross-lease section with its own separate driveway, carport and additional off-street parking, this delightful home offers both privacy and practicality.\r\n\r\nPerfect for first-home buyers, young families or downsizers looking for an easy-care coastal lifestyle.\r\n\r\nCute, charming and ready to enjoy - you'll simply love Lucy!\r\n\r\nCall Mel or Sam for a private viewing or see open homes as advertised.\r\n\r\nTo view/download property files please copy this link into your browser: https://www.harcourtsfiles.co.nz/listings/WALT",
